{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽帶大家認識營養豐富的潺菜，並分享了簡單美味的家常炒法。這道「辣椒蒜片炒潺菜」做法簡易，口感爽脆，並帶有獨特的香氣與微微辣勁，是一道非常開胃的蔬菜料理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"16c30648-8854-415f-9c92-74554691081f.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026Gn6QAEehcG1784628829.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"16c30648-8854-415f-9c92-74554691081f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>食材準備</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">潺菜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜蓉或蒜片</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">薑絲</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">辣椒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">油</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹽</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">少許糖</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">少量菇粉</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>烹調做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f8f3ada5-6cf6-45a3-8b14-f2fbbafe2df5.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026FB1aAzixbg1784628835.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f8f3ada5-6cf6-45a3-8b14-f2fbbafe2df5.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T01:09:49.953022+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}